<html>
  <head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>AI Print-on-Demand Prompt Pack</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>AI Print-on-Demand Prompt Pack</h1>
    <p>Use these prompts to create product ideas, design collections, listings, and launch plans for print-on-demand.</p>
    <h2>Prompts</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Generate 25 print-on-demand product ideas for [niche] customers. Include product type, design angle, and buyer motivation.</li>
      <li>Create a 20-design collection theme for [audience] around [occasion/trend]. Include visual direction and text ideas.</li>
      <li>Write AI image prompts for [style] designs that can be used on T-shirts, mugs, posters, and tote bags.</li>
      <li>Create Etsy listing titles, descriptions, and tags for this product: [product description].</li>
      <li>Build a launch checklist for testing 10 print-on-demand products in one niche.</li>
      <li>Write 5 ad angles for promoting a print-on-demand collection to [audience].</li>
      <li>Create mockup copy and product benefits for [product type].</li>
      <li>Generate seasonal product ideas for [holiday/season] in the [niche] market.</li>
      <li>Create a pricing plan for print-on-demand products with realistic margins.</li>
      <li>Write a simple product page for a best-selling design concept.</li>
    </ol>
  </body>
</html>
